==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schif|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|skif|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|skipą|lang=gem-pro}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{nds}} {{term|Schipp|lang=nds}}, {{fy}} {{term|skip|lang=fy}}, {{nl}} {{term|schip|lang=nl}}, {{yi}} {{term|שיף|tr=shif|lang=yi}}, {{en}} {{term|ship|lang=en}}, {{da}} {{term|skib|lang=da}}, {{sv}} {{term|skepp|lang=sv}}. Related also to {{lt}} {{term|skiebti|skiẽbti|to rip up|lang=lt}}, {{lv}} {{term|skibit|škibît|to cut, lop|lang=lv}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

